## State Management Patterns

### Local State (useState)
- Use for component-specific state
- Prefer multiple `useState` calls over single complex state object

### MobX Integration
Example in [src/pages/StateManagementPage/index.tsx](mdc:src/pages/StateManagementPage/index.tsx):
- Class-based stores with decorators
- Observable state with `makeObservable`
- Actions for state mutations

## Performance Optimization

### useCallback & useMemo
- Use `useCallback` for functions passed to child components
- Use `useMemo` for expensive calculations
- Include all dependencies in dependency arrays

### Component Optimization
- Use `React.memo` for pure functional components
- Avoid inline object/function creation in render

## Event Handling Patterns

### Modern (Hooks)
```typescript
const handleClick = useCallback(() => {
  // Handle click
}, [])

// In JSX
<button onClick={handleClick}>Click me</button>
```

### Class Components
```typescript
// Arrow function for auto-binding
handleClick = () => {
  // Handle click
}

// Or bind in constructor/JSX
onClick={this.handleClick.bind(this)}
```

